      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْهُودٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهِيدٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلْهُودٌ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُلَهَّدٌ</span></b> , but the
latter denotes frequency of the action, A man
<i>pushed, pushed away,</i> or <i>repelled, on account of his
baseness,</i> or <i>despicableness.</i> (S, L.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهَدَهُ</span>.

